      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey quick question. i hit my head pretty hard on the kitchen cabinet earlier. i have a little bump on my forehead and a bit of a headache but nothing is bleeding. the thing is i take eliquis for my afib... do i really need to go to the er right now or can i just sleep it off and see how i feel in the morning?",
