      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean, it was just a cabinet, not like a car accident or anything. the headache is really mild and i dont feel dizzy or anything. it seems crazy to go to the er just for a small bump. honestly the wait times there are huge and it's so expensive. are you sure i can't just take some tylenol and keep an eye on things at home for a few hours?",
